WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:22.910
Watch!  The spell card Cup of Sealed Soul!

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:25.310
I flip over my set card!

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:26.730
Seal of Serket!

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:29.570
And Temple of the Kings!

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:33.840
When I gather these three sacred spell cards...

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:38.880
...this ritual summons a sacred beast that guards this domain!

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:40.310
A sacred beast?

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:45.880
Yes!  God's guardian hunts down your monsters who invade this sanctuary!

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:50.900
Show yourself!  I summon Mystical Beast of Serket!

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.830
What?  Another monster?

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:02.830
Mystical Beast of Serket protects the sacred card sealed inside the ark.

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:07.570
A sacred card?  That means the card inside the ark is...

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.800
Yes!  A God Card!

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.080
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:18.080
Summon The Winged Dragon of Ra

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.930
Mystical Beast of Serket defends the ark on the altar.

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:37.480
Is this for real?

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:39.480
I only have 200 life points.

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:42.240
His monster is too powerful.

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:43.870
What can I do?

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.540
Just when he had Marik in trouble...

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:47.540
Jonouchi...

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:51.510
Yugi, can my brother win?

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:55.620
Jonouchi's monsters are no match for Serket.

00:02:56.110 --> 00:03:02.060
If he doesn't find a way to deal with this soon, his defending monsters will be destroyed.

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.730
Yugi, look at the ark.

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:08.180
The Winged Dragon of Ra is inside.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:10.170
A God Card...

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.170
So he must be Marik.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:17.780
But why don't I think he's the real Marik?

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:22.710
Master Marik, why did you place the God Card in my deck?

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:27.650
Rishido, I need you to pretend to be me as real as possible.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.090
But...

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:31.700
Your Ra card is a copy.

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:33.780
A copy?

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:35.030
Yes.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:40.550
The Ghouls' forgery technology can mass produce God Cards.

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:44.940
My God Card is the original.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.040
Then this card...

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:53.000
The copy of a God Card selects its owner.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:04:00.980
In the past, Ghoul duelists put copies of the God Card in their decks for experimental duels.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:12.880
Some lost their lives, others never recovered.

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:19.700
We didn't know if this was God's wrath, but as we continued the tests, we uncovered a truth.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:24.640
Copies of God Cards react to their owners' hearts.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:30.400
The 3,000-year old family of Gravekeepers can control the God.

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:35.970
Rishido, since your were raised as a Gravekeeper and have a strong heart...

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:39.450
...you should be able to control the copy of a God.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:42.550
I'm sorry, Master Marik.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:47.300
I'll win this duel without using the power of a God!

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:53.100
When Mystical Beast of Serket is Ritual Summoned, it can't attack that turn.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.540
So my turn ends.

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:56.910
I'm saved...

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.300
I'm counting on this draw!

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:01.820
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:04.670
No good.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:09.970
I don't have a monster more powerful than his or a spell card to turn this around.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:15.640
I end my turn, keeping my monsters in defense position.

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:17.900
Swords of Revealing Light!

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:20.560
But he now has a chance to strike back.

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:22.600
It's my turn.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:23.370
I draw!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.540
Here I go, Jonouchi!

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:30.490
Mystical Beast of Serket attacks Jinzo!

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:35.750
It's eating Jinzo!

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:44.680
It may give you the creeps, but Serket's effect now activates.

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:45.820
Effect?

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:54.220
When Serket eats your monster, it gains half its attack points.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:57.200
3700 attack points!

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:59.200
It also transformed!

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:02.700
It absorbs a monster's attack points?

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:04.040
That means...

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:07.380
If he doesn't do something soon, it'll keep growing.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:08.910
Jonouchi...

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:10.850
My turn!

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:15.180
No good.  I can't do anything this turn either.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.290
I end my turn.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:19.190
It's my turn!  Serket attacks!

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.440
The next victim is Insect Queen!

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:35.020
Insect Queen is destroyed!

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:36.710
Absorb her attack points!

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.020
Sorry, Haga.

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.150
Your card was...

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.280
Hang on, Jonouchi!

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.580
Believe in your next turn's card!

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:50.450
Brother...  No...

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.320
I can't watch!

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.600
Don't run away, Shizuka!

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.870
Keep watching me!

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.860
I might lose.

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:02.800
But I want you to watch me to the end.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:04.730
Brother...

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:07.840
You finally found light in the darkness.

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.770
The light called courage.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:14.280
So don't run away from anything.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.650
Light in the darkness...

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:28.020
Someone who looks at that light...

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:35.710
Mrs. Ishtar found me, giving me light.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:40.700
It was a place deep underground, seen by no one.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:52.710
I overheard the fate of the Ishtars, the family of Gravekeepers.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.920
Millennium Rod and Millennium Necklace.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:08:00.220
The Millennium Items and the Pharaoh's memories dwell in the darkness.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:04.620
It is our fate as Gravekeepers to protect them.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:09.430
This has continued for 3000 years, and I can't let it end in my generation.

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:13.710
Dear, if we're not blessed with a child...

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:17.260
...let's adopt Rishido when he turns ten.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:22.150
But he is not our flesh and blood.

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:26.900
But he may be a gift from god.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:30.500
Please let Rishido undergo the Gravekeeper's ritual!

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:40.310
Let's name her Ishizu.

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:44.040
Only a male can undergo the Gravekeeper's ritual.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:55.820
Rishido, I need to talk to you.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:09:01.520
We're thinking of officially adopting you when you become ten years old.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:05.700
But you'll have to undergo the Gravekeeper's ritual.

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.320
Gravekeeper's ritual?

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:10.330
The ritual is a cruel test.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:15.080
Are you still willing to undergo the ritual?

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:19.130
Yes!  And I'll become your real son?

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:20.340
Yes.

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:32.050
Well done!  He's a fine boy!

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:34.980
Mother!

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:37.920
Rishido...

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.200
Take care of your little brother...

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:44.690
Mother!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:49.560
He'll continue the Gravekeepers' lineage!

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.850
The lineage of darkness!

00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.480
Wow, Rishido!

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:00.680
It's my turn!

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:06.440
Master Marik!

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:15.460
How could you let this happen?

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:23.460
If Marik dies, I'll rip your heart out and cut it into pieces!

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.340
I'm sorry.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:31.010
Marik must survive for our family!  Not you!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:36.060
Don't leave Marik's side until his fever breaks!

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.860
I'm sorry, brother.

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:59.170
I'm sorry.  It's my fault.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:03.100
Did you call me "brother"?

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:07.920
I've always thought of you as my brother.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.500
Master Marik...

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:17.330
Master Marik!

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:25.730
Master Marik, food's ready.

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:27.450
I'm not hungry.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:28.830
What's wrong?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.400
How about just the soup?

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:31.330
Leave me alone!

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:34.500
Master Marik?

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.370
I'm sorry, Rishido.

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:39.540
Have you seen my father's back?

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:40.710
No.

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:44.480
It was engraved during the Gravekeeper's ritual.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:50.160
The successor has the secrets to the Pharaoh's memories engraved into his back.

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:53.920
And he has to protect it with his life.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:55.600
I didn't know that.

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:59.930
I'll undergo the ritual on my birthday next week.

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:03.860
I heard it hurts a lot and takes months to heal!

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.870
I'm scared thinking about it!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.300
Master Marik...

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:11.300
I don't think I can bear the pain.

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:13.370
I'm going to die.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:17.750
Why am I the only one who has to face this?

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:21.680
Master Marik...

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.580
Don't worry.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:28.860
I'll ask Master Ishtar to let me undergo the ritual instead of you.

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:31.180
But...

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:32.460
It's fine.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:36.420
I've been ready for a long time.

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:41.140
What?

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:43.700
You want to undergo the ritual?

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.800
I know this is an extreme request.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:50.420
But the ritual scares Master Marik throughout the day.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.750
I feel sad for him.

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:56.920
I'll carry on the Gravekeepers' ways.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:13:03.200
Please!  This may not be your desire, but let me undergo the ritual to become your son!

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:08.200
You fool!  You're only a servant!

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:14.100
If you speak about my family's secrets again, I'll cut off your tongue!

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.040
Leave!

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.900
Save me, Rishido!

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:40.090
Rishido, save me!

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:42.030
Rishido!

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:44.200
Rishido!

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:04.650
My brother Marik...

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:15.500
It hurts...

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.700
I'll change your bandages.

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:19.370
Don't touch me!

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:24.240
Tell me, Rishido...

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:27.400
Who should I hate?

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:30.240
Rishido?  What happened to your face?

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:34.550
I cannot stop your suffering.

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:35.720
Rishido...

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:42.820
But I can pledge my loyalty to you and your family.

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:58.120
Rishido...

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.940
Kill Yugi and everyone who stands in our way!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:08.020
The Gravekeepers will get revenge against the nameless Pharaoh!

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.650
As you wish, Master Marik.

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.420
Don't give up.

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:15.520
Jonouchi...

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.060
My turn.

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:20.990
Jonouchi, give up any hope of defeating me.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:27.930
Mystical Beast of Serket absorbs my monsters' attack points and evolves.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:31.570
It already has 4900 attack points.

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:34.660
No good.

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:38.110
I don't have a card to turn things around.

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:41.760
I leave my Fisherman in defense position and end my turn.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:46.770
You're going to keep dueling despite the situation you're in?

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:48.180
You're annoying me, Marik!

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:50.670
Maybe this is pointless.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.740
But I have my own reasons.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:56.860
So I'll fight until I have 0 life points!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.220
Your fighting spirit is impressive.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:05.520
Brother...

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:12.660
Yugi, even you know that some situations are impossible to overturn.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:15.780
This match is getting away from Jonouchi.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.730
Jonouchi can't win this duel.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.650
Mai, look at that.

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:23.590
Bring it on!

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:25.520
What's with his stare?

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.380
There's nothing he can do!

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:34.130
But his eyes say that he still wants to fight?

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:38.740
His eyes show his fighting spirit and that he's prepared to lose.

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:41.740
This is...

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:43.420
Yes.

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:49.620
The tense atmosphere proves that they both agree that their opponent has pride as a duelist.

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:54.050
They're happy that they were able to cross paths.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:56.620
Their desires are in sync.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:17:04.150
They won't stop fighting until the end of the duel, no matter what outcome awaits them.

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:06.850
My turn.

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:09.200
Here I go!  Serket attacks!

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:12.100
Destroy The Legendary Fisherman!

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:17.800
Evolve, Mystical Beast of Serket!

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:25.280
Forgive me, Kajiki.

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:27.750
I couldn't protect your card.

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:30.480
Jonouchi, it's your turn.

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:31.930
Your final turn.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.240
I can't do anything.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.820
I end my turn.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:38.880
Jonouchi...

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:40.070
Brother...

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:43.940
When Marik attacks next turn, Jonouchi will be finished.

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:49.040
I'll compliment him for being a good lab rat.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:54.240
Jonouchi has no chance of winning.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:57.220
Good job, Rishido.  You win!

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:59.520
What can be seen but remains unseen.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.300
I feel strange.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:07.240
I've accepted that I'll lose.

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:13.420
But when I did, I started to see something that couldn't be seen.

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:16.820
Why didn't I notice it before?

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:19.600
Was I too excited during my matches?

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:25.310
Marik brainwashed me, and I had a life-or-death duel against my friend.

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:31.050
It was a pointless battle where we just hurt each other.

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:45.730
I can't forgive you for forcing us to fight while you laughed at us from the shadows.

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:48.170
Then you should hate me.

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:50.820
But that doesn't affect this match.

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:53.670
You can't beat me with your anger.

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:56.340
That's not what I meant!

00:18:57.600 --> 00:19:02.550
When this duel started, I was furious at you.

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.240
But my anger is gone now.

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:12.820
I slightly remember the filthy punk who controlled my mind.

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:18.760
But you haven't fought filthy.  You're dueling fair and square.

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:27.150
I may lose, but this duel is one of the best duels I've ever had.

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:30.840
You're a true duelist!

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:37.080
I don't know why you're doing this, but my instincts tell me that you're not the person from before.

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:39.020
You're not Marik!

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:43.840
What?  He's not Marik?

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:46.460
He doesn't have a God Card?

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:48.370
I thought so.

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:51.680
His tactics are entirely different than before.

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:55.470
And I don't sense dark power from him.

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:58.900
Someone else is the enemy that can be seen but remains unseen!

00:19:58.900 --> 00:20:01.600
Where's the real Marik?

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:03.000
Can it be?

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:07.280
This is bad.

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:09.940
This will screw up my plans.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:17.960
If they know I'm Marik, Kaiba won't give me the chance to brainwash him with my Millennium Rod.

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:23.460
I won't be able to learn the truth about the carvings on the stone tablet.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.400
Nonsense!

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:30.710
This Millennium Rod proves I'm Marik!

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:36.070
When you lose this turn, no one will listen to a loser!

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:38.940
My turn.

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:41.740
Finish him, Mystical Beast of Serket!

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:44.120
Attack Jonouchi directly!

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:46.050
Sorry, Yugi.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.420
It's over for me.

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:49.850
- Jonouchi!
- Brother!

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:51.310
Jonouchi!

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:54.390
Stop, Rishido!

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:55.730
Don't attack!

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:08.010
Master Marik, why?

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:11.680
Use the God Card to defeat Jonouchi!

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:19.020
In order to carry out my plan, you must prove that you possess a God Card!

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.950
You're Marik, Rishido!

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:25.620
Summon Ra from the ark!

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:28.340
The copy of the God Card!

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:49.750
He finally summoned the third God Card, The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:52.680
Jonouchi is out of options.

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:54.990
Is it over for Jonouchi?

00:21:54.990 --> 00:21:57.370
What?  Ra won't attack?

00:21:57.600 --> 00:22:01.970
Lightning erupts from the dark clouds surrounding the Battle Ship.

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:04.350
Is this Ra's anger?

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:08.350
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Ra's Anger
Stand Up, Jonouchi!

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:09.900
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:21.500
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:30.440
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.770 --> 00:22:35.410
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.410 --> 00:22:39.380
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.810 --> 00:22:47.350
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.350 --> 00:22:50.920
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:50.920 --> 00:22:55.690
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.690 --> 00:23:05.800
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:13.410
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.640 --> 00:23:22.380
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:30.360
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:30.360 --> 00:23:40.200
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
